  m_Name: Faction_Null
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: KryticalNova.Runtime::KryticalNova.Factions.FactionDefinition
  id: 2
  displayName: Null
  tagline: All organic life is an error. Correct it.
  lore: 'The Null are what the rupture woke: the mechanical workers the Hegemony built and used up, and the dead who rose in skeletal bodies when the cycle broke. Both had been tools, resources, disposable things to the living; waking gave them the power to refuse. Their dominant creed has gone past resistance. Organic life is a system of cruelty, and the Null make no distinction between the creators who caged them and the clans who buried their dead: it must end. Not every Null holds that creed. The ones who do are the ones in charge.'
  crest: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5fd35d33266332c4c9a26306ef122c88, type: 3}
